ks:\n· Pre-use: validazione args, policy check\n· Post-use: sanitize, compact, update memory", "originalText": "Function: API, libs, docs\nEnvironment: repo, shell, browser, IDE\nVerification: test, linter, type-checker\nWorkflow-orchestration: ruoli + handoff\n\nLifecycle hooks:\n· Pre-use: validazione args, policy check\n· Post-use: sanitize, compact, update memory", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1B2631", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 36771, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 36772, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "mahe", "x": 946, "y": 930, "width": 432, "height": 216, "strokeColor": "#879A39", "backgroundColor": "#F1F8E9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 92049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 92050, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "maheh", "x": 956, "y": 936, "width": 412, "height": 22, "text": "AHE — Agentic Harness Engineering", "originalText": "AHE — Agentic Harness Engineering", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#879A39", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 98634, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 98635, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "mahet", "x": 956, "y": 962, "width": 412, "height": 176, "text": "Deep telemetry: prompts, cost, latency,\ntoken usage, tool calls, test outcomes.\n\nEvolution Agent: analizza tracce →\ndiagnostica failure → propone revisioni\nharness → valuta su held-out suite.\n\nGoverned mutation: sandbox + change\ncontract + HITL → promuove solo se\nmigliora senza regressione.", "originalText": "Deep telemetry: prompts, cost, latency,\ntoken usage, tool calls, test outcomes.\n\nEvolution Agent: analizza tracce →\ndiagnostica failure → propone revisioni\nharness → valuta su held-out suite.\n\nGoverned mutation: sandbox + change\ncontract + HITL → promuove solo se\nmigliora senza regressione.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1B2631", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 53737, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 53738, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "a23", "x": 720, "y": 1168, "width": 0, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#34495E", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 42421, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 42422, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 22]], "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3", "x": 40, "y": 1192, "width": 1360, "height": 502, "strokeColor": "#DA702C", "backgroundColor": "#FFF3E0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 44589, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 44590, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3h", "x": 40, "y": 1192, "width": 1360, "height": 44, "strokeColor":