fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 81655, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 81656, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r1t", "x": 62, "y": 1292, "width": 290, "height": 384, "text": "planner → decompone obiettivi\ncoder → genera/revisiona codice\ntester → crea ed esegue test\nreviewer → valuta correttezza\nexecutor → runs deterministici\n\nNovelty EvoMAC:\nGradient Agent:\n→ attribuisce failure ad\n  agenti specifici\nUpdating Agent:\n→ modifica prompt e\n  topologia DAG", "originalText": "planner → decompone obiettivi\ncoder → genera/revisiona codice\ntester → crea ed esegue test\nreviewer → valuta correttezza\nexecutor → runs deterministici\n\nNovelty EvoMAC:\nGradient Agent:\n→ attribuisce failure ad\n  agenti specifici\nUpdating Agent:\n→ modifica prompt e\n  topologia DAG", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1B2631", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 61550, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 61551, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3r2", "x": 376, "y": 1248, "width": 300, "height": 436, "strokeColor": "#DA702C", "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 61822, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 61823, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3r2h", "x": 376, "y": 1248, "width": 300, "height": 34, "strokeColor": "#DA702C", "backgroundColor": "#DA702C", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 2009, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2010, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r2ht", "x": 384, "y": 1252, "width": 284, "height": 26, "text": "INTERACTION MODES", "originalText": "INTERACTION MODES", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 86006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 86007, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r2t", "x": 386, "y": 1292, "width": 280, "height": 384, "text": "1. Collaborative synthesis\n   pair programming → crea insieme\n\n2. Critique-repair ★ dominante\n   verificatore → propone fix\n   coder → applica\n\n3. Adversarial validation\n   fuzzer → crash-inducing input\n   bug che LLM non immagina\n   (AutoSafeCoder)\n\n4. Reasoning debate\n   agenti argumentano\n   majority vote → decisione\n   (CANDOR)", "originalText": "1. Collaborative synthesis\n   pair programming → crea insieme\n\n2. Critique-repair ★ dominante\n   verificatore → propone fix\n   coder → applica\n\n3. Adversarial validation\n   fuzzer → crash-inducing input\n   bug che LLM non immagina\n   (AutoSafeCoder)\n\n4. Reasoning debate\n   agenti argumentano\n   majority vote → decisione\n   (CANDOR)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1B2631", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 63006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 63007, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3r3", "x": 690, "y": 1248, "width": 290, "height": 436, "strokeColor": "#DA702C", "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 73236, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 73237, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3r3h", "x": 690, "y": 1248, "width": 290, "height": 34, "strokeColor": "#DA702C", "backgroundColor": "#DA702C", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 57880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 57881, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r3ht", "x": 698, "y": 1252, "width": 274, "height": 26, "text": "TOPOLOGIE", "originalText": "TOPOLOGIE", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 25812, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 25813, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r3t", "x": 700, "y": 1292, "width": 270, "height": 384, "text": "chain/waterfall\n→ A→B→C lineare (ChatDev)\n\ncyclic/agile\n→ loop con feedback\n  (AgentCoder)\n\nhierarchical\n→ manager→workers\n  (MAGIS, HyperAgent)\n\nstar\n→ hub centrale (CANDOR)\n\nadaptive\n→ topologia ottimizzata\n  (EvoMAC, FlowReasoner)\n\nPattern chiave:\ntopologia complessa\n= substrato implicito\nsubstrato esplicito\n= topologia semplice", "originalText": "chain/waterfall\n→ A→B→C lineare (ChatDev)\n\ncyclic/agile\n→ loop con feedback\n  (AgentCoder)\n\nhierarchical\n→ manager→workers\n  (MAGIS, HyperAgent)\n\nstar\n→ hub centrale (CANDOR)\n\nadaptive\n→ topologia ottimizzata\n  (EvoMAC, FlowReasoner)\n\nPattern chiave:\ntopologia complessa\n= substrato implicito\nsubstrato esplicito\n= topologia semplice", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1B2631", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 21873, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 21874, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3r4", "x": 994, "y": 1248, "width": 396, "height": 436, "strokeColor": "#D14D41", "backgroundColor": "#FFEBEE", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 63690, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 63691, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s3r4h", "x": 994, "y": 1248, "width": 396, "height": 34, "strokeColor": "#D14D41", "backgroundColor": "#D14D41", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 7185, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7186, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r4ht", "x": 1002, "y": 1252, "width": 380, "height": 26, "text": "GAP PRINCIPALE", "originalText": "GAP PRINCIPALE", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 72980, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 72981, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "s3r4t", "x": 1004, "y": 1292, "width": 376, "height": 384, "text": "Shared State (4 livelli):\n\nimplicit/file ← la maggioranza\n→ stato ricostruito dalla conversazione\n→ agenti non rilevano divergenze\n\nrepository → struttura navigabile\n\nexecution-based → test = oracolo\n\nblackboard/formal\n→ stato persistente e queryable\n→ solo L2MAC, SyncMind lo fanno\n\nConvergenza:\ntest-gated · security · performance\nscore-based · consensus · implicit\n\n⚠ La maggioranza usa\nimplicit convergence\n= iterazioni fisse, nessun criterio\noggettivo di qualità", "originalText": "Shared State (4 livelli):\n\nimplicit/file ← la maggioranza\n→ stato ricostruito dalla conversazione\n→ agenti non rilevano divergenze\n\nrepository → struttura navigabile\n\nexecution-based → test = oracolo\n\nblackboard/formal\n→ stato persistente e queryable\n→ solo L2MAC, SyncMind lo fanno\n\nConvergenza:\ntest-gated · security · performance\nscore-based · consensus · implicit\n\n⚠ La maggioranza usa\nimplicit convergence\n= iterazioni fisse, nessun criterio\noggettivo di qualità", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#D14D41", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 57797, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 57798, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "a34", "x": 720, "y": 1696, "width": 0, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#34495E", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", 